" GodotVim — Quick Start & Reference
" Copy to your project root as .godot-vimrc (or use :mappings for a GUI).
" The plugin works with zero config — everything below is opt-in.

" ══ Godot Commands ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
" :save :saveall :savescene          Save file / all / current scene
" :run :runcurrent :stop :pause      Scene playback (F5/F6 equivalents)
" :GodotBreakpoint                   Toggle breakpoint on current line
" :GodotContinue :GodotNext          Debugger continue / step over
" :GodotStepIn :GodotStepOut         Debugger step into / out
" :FileSystem :Inspector :Scene      Focus dock by name
" :Script :Output                    Switch to Script editor / Output panel
" :zen :unzen                        Distraction-free mode toggle
" :mappings                          Open key mapping dialog (GUI)
" :actionlist [filter]               Discover all available commands
" :panelmap [keys]                   List / explain panel key bindings
"
" ── Navigation (defaults — rebindable, see Panel Bindings) ────────────────
" Ctrl-h/j/k/l                       Move focus between panels (spatial)
" Ctrl-W w / Ctrl-W W                Cycle focus (from the script editor)
" h/j/k/l in docks                   Navigate Tree/ItemList items
" / in docks                         Jump to search box
" a/d/r/y/R in FileSystem            Create / delete / rename / yank path / refresh
" J/K/G/y in Debugger                Next / prev / deepest stack frame, yank row
" gd                                 Go to definition (LSP)
" K                                  Hover documentation (LSP)

" ══ Configuration ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
" Leader must come before any <Leader> mappings.
let mapleader = " "
set timeoutlen=1000

" ══ Panel Bindings (uncomment to change) ══════════════════════════════════
" Keys OUTSIDE the script editor are a table you can edit: panel focus, dock
" navigation, the FileSystem dock, the debugger, and the completion popup.
" Run :panelmap to list every live binding and every line that was rejected.
" Full grammar: docs/REFERENCE.md#panel-key-bindings-panelmap
"
"   panelmap   [<flag> ...] <surface> <keys> <target> [key=value ...]
"   panelunmap <surface> <keys>
"
" Surfaces   panel  dock  dock.filesystem  dock.debugger  searchbox  prompt
"            editor.nav  editor.completion  unknown
"            (editor.insert and foreign are barriers and take no bindings;
"            editor.completion is an overlay: the script editor in an
"            insert-like mode, live per keystroke rather than by focus)
"            A deeper surface wins: a rule on dock.filesystem beats the same
"            key on dock, which beats the same key on panel.
" Targets    a godotvim.* action id, or `native` to hand the key to Godot.
" Flags      <physical> also match the US-QWERTY key POSITION — drop it and
"                       the key dies on Colemak / Dvorak / AZERTY
"            <void>     consume even when the action declines; on the panel
"                       chords, dropping it leaks them to Godot at the
"                       layout's edges
"            <norepeat> ignore auto-repeat while the key is held
"            <shift>    also match with Shift held (named keys only)
"            <nowait>   fire now instead of waiting for a longer sequence
" Params     count=N (1-100), at most 4 pairs, decimal integers only.
"
" Rebinding is panelunmap + panelmap: adding a key never removes the old one.
"
" ── Cycle panel focus on Alt+] / Alt+[ ───────────────────────────────────
"    Ships unbound: Ctrl-W w / Ctrl-W W only cycle from the script editor.
" panelmap <physical> <void> <norepeat> panel <M-]> godotvim.focus.cycle_next
" panelmap <physical> <void> <norepeat> panel <M-[> godotvim.focus.cycle_prev
"
" ── Panel focus on Alt instead of Ctrl ────────────────────────────────────
" panelunmap panel <C-h>
" panelunmap panel <C-j>
" panelunmap panel <C-k>
" panelunmap panel <C-l>
" panelmap <physical> <void> <norepeat> panel <M-h> godotvim.focus.left
" panelmap <physical> <void> <norepeat> panel <M-j> godotvim.focus.down
" panelmap <physical> <void> <norepeat> panel <M-k> godotvim.focus.up
" panelmap <physical> <void> <norepeat> panel <M-l> godotvim.focus.right
"
" ── Dock navigation on Colemak's home row ─────────────────────────────────
" panelunmap dock j
" panelunmap dock k
" panelmap <physical> dock n godotvim.item.next
" panelmap <physical> dock e godotvim.item.prev
"
" ── Require dd to delete in the FileSystem dock ───────────────────────────
" panelunmap dock.filesystem d
" panelmap <physical> dock.filesystem dd godotvim.fs.delete
"
" ── Completion: Tab and Enter accept even an unchosen candidate ───────────
"    (Ctrl-Y and Ctrl-E ship as defaults; this restores the pre-1.8 accept.)
" panelmap editor.completion <Tab> godotvim.completion.confirm require_selection=0
" panelmap editor.completion <CR> godotvim.completion.confirm require_selection=0
"
" ── Completion: two-stage Escape ──────────────────────────────────────────
"    First press closes the popup and stays in Insert; second press leaves.
" panelmap editor.completion <Esc> godotvim.completion.dismiss
"
" ── Half-page dock movement ───────────────────────────────────────────────
" panelmap dock <C-d> godotvim.item.next count=10
" panelmap dock <C-u> godotvim.item.prev count=10

" ══ Presets (uncomment to enable) ═════════════════════════════════════════
" Managed by :mappings dialog. Manual edits here are preserved on save.
"
" ── Insert Escapes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
" preset:disabled
" inoremap jk <Esc>
" preset:disabled
" inoremap jj <Esc>
"
" ── File / Buffer ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>w :save<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>W :saveall<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>n :bn<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>p :bp<CR>
"
" ── Scene & Debugging ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>r :run<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>R :runcurrent<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>S :stop<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>db :GodotBreakpoint<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>dc :GodotContinue<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>dn :GodotNext<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>di :GodotStepIn<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>do :GodotStepOut<CR>
"
" ── Navigation & Editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>e :FileSystem<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>i :Inspector<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>s :Script<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>z :zen<CR>
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Space>Z :unzen<CR>
"
" ── Search ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
" preset:disabled
" nnoremap <Esc> :noh<CR>

" ══ Your Mappings ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
" nnoremap Y y$
" vnoremap < <gv
" vnoremap > >gv
" nnoremap n nzz
" nnoremap N Nzz

" ══ Settings & Help ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
" Editor Settings → Plugins → GodotVim   enabled toggle, scrolloff, etc.
" :mappings                               GUI for managing all key bindings
" :actionlist                             Discover every available command
" :panelmap                               List panel bindings + rejected lines
" :panelmap {keys}                        Explain how one key resolves here
